Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dex AI Operations Agent: an independent travel-operations demo.\NAll bookings and contracts are fictional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Qwen3 4B proposes tools locally. The server validates every call.\NThe model cannot execute SQL, grant access, approve or send.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,USD 1,500 outstanding; passport copy missing.\NPayment and document deadlines are grounded in cited contract excerpts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Three validated tools: booking lookup, contract retrieval, reminder draft.\NThe run records latency, model calls and token usage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A human reviews the exact message, evidence and test recipient.\NApproval binds its payload hash; the worker rechecks current data and access.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The approved action reaches Mailpit, the local test inbox.\NNo production traveler receives this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspect the same trace ID from request through approved delivery.\NThis companion viewer renders the actual authorized API snapshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.83,0:01:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The full stream retains decisions, arguments, permission checks and results.\NErrors and attempts are recorded; SMTP uncertainty is never blindly retried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,98 passing test cases include 60 system evaluation scenarios.\N8/8 live Qwen cases and 4/4 adversarial cases are reported separately.
